Subject: [PATCH] Capture local JetPack 7.2 Edge-AI build and deployment changes

Base-commit: a4acce6fa6d06c047c367bb5f8546583f7434a85
Tracked BSP and upstream source files were unchanged during the build.
This additive patch packages local build configuration, scripts and metadata,
replay helpers, and the extracted-flasher automount fix prepared on 2026-10-03.
The immutable image archive and rootfs are unchanged. Hardware retry pending.
See build-support/jetpack-7.2-blacksail/README.txt for build scope and use,
and deployment/README.txt for the flashing fix and its captured evidence.

